+# TLS backend
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use rustls as the TLS backend. It was chosen as a pure Rust TLS implementation, which avoids C binding dependencies and reduces the external dependency surface. This decision was recorded on 2026-09-26 and is the only TLS backend decision currently on record.
